OL,3,GNEWSAWildfires are UK's 'new reality',
OL,4,AMPs warn
OL,5,
OL,6,FRecord wildfires that destroyed homes,
OL,7,Fscorched thousands of hectares of
OL,8,Fcountryside and stretched fire crews
OL,9,Facross the UK exposed weaknesses in
OL,10,Fpreparedness, a committee of MPs has
OL,11,Fwarned.
OL,13,FThe Environment, Food and Rural Affairs
OL,14,FCommittee said firefighting aircraft,
OL,15,Fdisposable barbecue restrictions and a
OL,16,Fpublic awareness campaign were needed
OL,17,Fto tackle rising wildfire risk.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
