OL,3,GNEWSAWildfires are UK's 'new reality',
OL,4,AMPs warn
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe report follows this year's severe
OL,7,Fwildfire season, including fires that
OL,8,Fprompted military deployment in south
OL,9,FWales, destroyed 19 homes in
OL,10,FStourbridge and scorched land in the
OL,11,FCairngorms, Staffordshire and Suffolk.
OL,13,FThe government said improving wildfire
OL,14,Fpreparedness was a "major priority".
